  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">swissREPAT-IOM-Movements (SIM)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to support migrants who are willing to return voluntarily to their countries of origin. Different schemes of assistance are offered to migrants during their return journey both in Switzerland, in the country of transit and in the country of return. Moreover, IOM will organize specific assistance for persons in situation of vulnerabiliy upon request.</narrative>
  </description>
